[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801798726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105382#issuecomment-2801798726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105382","id":2801798726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nAA5G","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T13:54:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T13:55:05Z","body":"I ran a couple more tests and everything breaks when using .duplicate() on the tile's material. I also checked on 4.5 dev2 [af2c713] and while there are no errors in the console, it doesn't work at all-in other words, the problem persists but without throwing an error.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801798726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801867699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105382#issuecomment-2801867699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105382","id":2801867699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nARuz","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T14:16:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T13:55:02Z","body":"Found a solution to this problem. I double-checked, and there is no issue on this topic, and it seems to be fixed in 4.5 dev2, however I'm not sure if it's supposed to work this way. In general, you cannot duplicate the material inside _tile_data_runtime_update, because it simply won’t work there.\n```gdscript\nextends TileMapLayer\n\nfunc _use_tile_data_runtime_update(coords: Vector2i) -> bool:\n\treturn coords.x < 10\n\nfunc _tile_data_runtime_update(coords: Vector2i, tileData: TileData) -> void:\n\tvar clone: ShaderMaterial = tileData.material.duplicate()\n\tclone.resource_local_to_scene = true\n\tprint(clone,\" <-> \",tileData.material)\n\t\n\tclone.set_shader_parameter(\"color\", Color(0, 1, 0))\n\ttileData.material = clone\n\t\n\tprint(tileData.material, tileData.material.get_shader_parameter(\"color\"))\n```\n In the console, you can see the tile color in the material, and also that it's a duplicated shader and it was applied without errors. However, you can't see its effect. For now, the solution is to duplicate the material outside this function in advance, then the material is displayed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801867699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801934615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105382#issuecomment-2801934615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105382","id":2801934615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nAiEX","user":{"login":"miruji","id":147953988,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNGZRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147953988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji","html_url":"https://github.com/miruji","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miruji/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T14:36:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T13:55:21Z","body":"Also related to this topic: please add to the documentation for `_use_tile_data_runtime_update` that it is called when a tile is replaced with another tile. This is not currently documented. (I haven’t tested it, but it most likely applies to tiles that have not yet been rendered.) This behavior might catch developers off guard if they are unaware of it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801934615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]